message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "paired.exchange"
abstract: "Launch a coin paired with real stocks. Permissionless, fixed supply, liquidity nobody can pull. On Robinhood Chain. Every coin here is quoted in a tokenized equity rather than a stablecoin or the chain's gas token. A coin paired with NVDA trades against NVDA: its price, its depth, and the fees it pays its creator are all denominated in the stock."
